Oh, it's a really funny movie.

1420
00:58:54.560 --> 00:58:55.660
I need to see it.

1421
00:58:55.900 --> 00:58:56.260
Yeah.

1422
00:58:56.440 --> 00:58:57.160
I mean, I love Clark.

1423
00:58:57.920 --> 00:58:59.900
But yeah, I hear you on all of that.

1424
00:59:00.360 --> 00:59:00.780
Yeah.

1425
00:59:00.920 --> 00:59:01.540
I hear ya.

1426
00:59:02.000 --> 00:59:02.360
Mm-hmm.

1427
00:59:04.240 --> 00:59:05.420
Anywho, I'll leave it there.

1428
00:59:05.420 --> 00:59:09.440
We'll leave it there, and we're going to save it for our spinoff podcast, Office Ladies

1429
