So I went to the shooting draft, and your actual line is, Dwight, that's a license plate.

1441
00:59:50.910 --> 00:59:53.810
But I said license number, and it stayed in.

1442
00:59:53.830 --> 00:59:55.910
You just fumbled it, and it stayed in.

1443
00:59:55.910 --> 00:59:57.710
But it cracked me up.

1444
00:59:58.210 --> 01:00:03.610
And it's a very sweet moment, though, between Dwight and Pam, because Dwight says, you are

1445
01:00:03.610 --> 01:00:04.170
my friend.

1446
01:00:05.030 --> 01:00:05.190
Yeah.

1447
01:00:05.470 --> 01:00:05.730
Yeah.

1448
01:00:05.950 --> 01:00:07.390
I always love those moments.

1449
01:00:07.730 --> 01:00:07.890
Me too.

1450
01:00:07.890 --> 01:00:12.110
There's a really great episode coming up that actually Lee, my husband Lee, directed.

1451
01:00:12.490 --> 01:00:13.730
It's vandalism.

1452
01:00:14.130 --> 01:00:18.730
And Pam and Dwight are going to team up to figure out who vandalized something.

1453
01:00:18.930 --> 01:00:20.370
I won't, I guess, spoil it.

1454
01:00:20.530 --> 01:00:22.410
But this is a duo I love.

1455
01:00:22.490 --> 01:00:24.790
I love Pam and Dwight, and I love Angela and Oscar.

1456
01:00:24.790 --> 01:00:25.290
Me too.

1457
01:00:26.030 --> 01:00:28.230
All right, you guys, that was The Whale.

1458
01:00:28.410 --> 01:00:32.490
We want to thank you all for writing in and sending your questions and your comments.

1459
